          %p
            Using some theory of terminal coalgebras, Leinster and Cheng described a viable notion of Trimble
            = succeed "-category." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mn ∞
